      "@id": "ihh:F-0002",
      "@type": "Claim",
      "text": "The U.S. National Archives holds Hedy Lamarr's naturalization file under the name Hedwig Maria Stauffer; NARA lists her other names as Hedy Lamarr, Hedwig Kiesler Mandl Markey, Hedy Kiesler, Hedy Mandl, and Hedy Markey. The file contains a certificate of arrival, declaration of intention, affidavits of witnesses, and petition for naturalization.",
